@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
title Design — Catalog services
top to bottom direction
class catalog {
  + search(...)
}
class material_source {
  + resolve(...)
  + publish(...)
}
class profiles {
  + load(profileid)
  + save(json, profileid)
}
class profile_config {
  + resolve(course)
  + get_config()
}
class indexer {
  + refresh(courseid)
}
catalog --> material_source
catalog --> profiles
profiles --> profile_config
indexer --> profiles
material_source --> profiles
catalog -[hidden]right-> indexer
note bottom of material_source : Current visibility and source authority are decisive.
@enduml
